Data file {#Sec8}
---------

Use an Excel database with saved 'Data file' link. As part of the submission, upload the file through the Manuscript Submission Portal. This is a further condition on acceptance, but part of the submitted file. The file must be accessible to the Editor only once the paper has been published, and remains so only for a reasonable period afterwards. All the data that describe how the authors obtained their data (vide infra) must be included in this file. The full database will include the name of each author and a link to a file on their website where the data is
